   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Venice AI · Image edit / combine references\n\n* **image_1** = image to edit. **image_2 … image_6** and **extra_images** (batch) = more references; sizes may differ.\n* One image → edit, several → combined. Refer to them in the prompt: *\"the person from image 1 … the sofa from image 2\"*.\n* The model list shows **max N img** (`1 img` = Luma, no combining; `multi img` = no limit stated). Too many images stop the run **before** anything is billed.\n* Some models charge per extra input image (`+` in the price).\n* **aspect_ratio auto** = format of image_1. Change **variation** for another result.\n\nUncensored edit models: Qwen Edit Uncensored, Qwen Image 2.1/3, Seedream V4.5/V5. Up to 10 images: Qwen Image 2.1 Pro Edit.\n\nAll edit models: [MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild bearbeiten oder mehrere Referenzbilder kombinieren. [MODELS.de.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.de.md)\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Venice AI · Image edit / combine references\n\n* **image_1** = image to edit. **image_2 … image_6** and **extra_images** (batch) = more references; sizes may differ.\n* One image → edit, several → combined. Refer to them in the prompt: *\"the person from image 1 … the sofa from image 2\"*.\n* The model list shows **max N img** (`1 img` = Luma, no combining; `multi img` = no limit stated). Too many images stop the run **before** anything is billed.\n* Some models charge per extra input image (`+` in the price).\n* **aspect_ratio auto** = format of image_1. Change **variation** for another result.\n\nUncensored edit models: Qwen Edit Uncensored, Qwen Image 2.1/3, Seedream V4.5/V5. Up to 10 images: Qwen Image 2.1 Pro Edit.\n\nAll edit models: [MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild bearbeiten oder mehrere Referenzbilder kombinieren. [MODELS.de.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.de.md)\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   },
